    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated in one of the most sought-after residential developments in Nenagh town, No. 41 Ciamaltha Meadows is a well presented four bedroom semi-detached home with an attached garage.\n\nThe property features a welcoming, wide entrance hall with a fully tiled floor and a guest WC. To the front of the house is a comfortable living room with an open fireplace, while to the rear is a bright and spacious kitchen/dining room, ideal for modern family living.\n\nThe kitchen is fitted with contemporary grey units and provides direct access to the attached garage, which is plumbed for a washing machine and offers additional storage space. The rear lawned garden benefits from the evening sun.\n\nUpstairs, there are four generously sized double bedrooms, all with built-in wardrobes. The master bedroom benefits from a fully tiled en-suite bathroom.\n\nThis attractive property would make an ideal family home, first-time buyer residence, or retirement property. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.4w x 5.182d\nTiled flooring\n\nLiving Room - 4.272w x 5.220\nLeft hand side of hallway, timber floor, open fire\n\nKitchen - 3.325w x 4.082d\nGrey fitted units, cream worktops, tiled\n\nDining Area - 3.339w x 4.096d\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.885w x 4.00d\nCarpet, Built in Wardrobe\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.218w x 3.725d\nEnsuite\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.016w x 1.975d\nFully tiled, electric shower\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.600w x 3.243d\nCarpet, Built in Wardrobe\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.100w x 2.285d\nCarpet, Built in Wardrobe\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.030w x 1.697d\nElectric shower, bath, wc, whb\n\nAttached Garage - 2.367w x 5.871d\nPlumbed for washing machine\n\n"
      },
